# Archive

Early experiments, kept for history. Not maintained and not used by the current eval.

| File | What it is |
|---|---|
| `baseline.py`, `baseline_results.json` | Day 2 baseline: 5 questions, raw schema only (2/5) |
| `results_raw.json`, `results_semantic.json` | Week 1: the same 5 questions at temperature 0 (raw 3/5, semantic 5/5) |
| `results_agent.json` | Week 2: a full-agent run from before results were split into dev and holdout |

Current results are in `eval/results_<mode>_<set>.json`, produced by `python -m eval.run_eval`.